vuelta config init — create an empty validated configuration without scanner image pins

Examples:
  vuelta config init
  vuelta config init --replace --yes

Usage:
  vuelta config init [options] [config-path]

Options:
  --replace                  replace an existing config after review
  --yes                      confirm the displayed replacement diff
  --non-interactive          legacy alias for --no-input

Defaults:
  Config: operating system user config path unless --config or config-path is set.
  Boolean options: disabled unless specified.

Global options:
  -c, --config PATH          use an alternate config.yaml
  --no-input                 disable prompts; does not confirm changes
  --no-color                 disable color and terminal formatting
  -h, --help                 show help and exit
  --version                  show version and exit

Security:
  Replacement requires --replace and confirmation; --yes confirms only the displayed diff.
